<title>BELGIUM: EU panel to discuss Spain maize import quota Thurs.</title>
<headline>EU panel to discuss Spain maize import quota Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's cereals management committee will on Thursday discuss the next tranche of preferential maize imports into Spain, Commission officials said.</p>
<p>They estimated it involved more than 500,000 tonnes remaining under the 1996 quota.</p>
</text>
